{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"5c440b82c99f8f5140bead4e726dfc742e0206c02cc0c4d96a49b118d1abf4d9","ja":"ピンチは突然に","zh":"危机突然来临","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"37a3e05d14f2ee73da1d7bea57f4a817931f3618816579a6cc10de4136f8e66a","ja":"ドアの奥をだいぶ進んだ頃……","zh":"走过门后很长一段路时……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8874ecf4f0e6d10db4d9a29801d58b5e5fbf053191f57555d97e0c1183d6d3ba","ja":"あ、あれ……？　星梨花ちゃんの匂い……と、突然、\n消えちゃいました……ここまでは、残ってたのに……。","zh":"啊、咦……？星梨花的气味……突、突然间，消失了……明明到这里都还留着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"47ecebc8d15e0367ad155dbf5af5737c463fd601041f0bb35be180ca40839fe5","ja":"それは困りましたね～。突然匂いが\n消えるなんて……まるで、難事件のようですな～。","zh":"这可真棘手啊～。气味居然突然消失了……简直就像一起疑难案件呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e8eae940abc2b1c9e239f43b0b627f613fff971e9500e8aa2894a0a951a17452","ja":"あ、あと……美也さん。私たちって……ど、どっちから\n来たんでしたっけ……？　く、暗くて方向が……。","zh":"啊，还有……美也。我们……是、是从哪边过来的来着……？太、太暗了，分不清方向……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0927d9e9e751b7736fdb4852ad1f81278aab0b1b2f2f1b8c96839ca4a64b89ac","ja":"む～ん……残念ながら私にわかるのは、\n今の状況が二重遭難ということだけですな～。","zh":"唔～……很遗憾，我能明白的只有，\n现在的状况属于二重遇险～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"784a87b5356784b2f2269b8a7fc68465db29998f24e471341c56c3ebb82be04f","ja":"も、もしかして私たち……ぴ、ピンチですか……？\nど、どど、どうしよう～……！？","zh":"难、难道我们……陷、陷入危机了吗……？\n怎、怎怎、怎么办～……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"bca887b83cf13b5d9b267b8310583a4218ba5972023fdf52e1eff7745b43ce42","ja":"……？　あの、ひなたさん。\n今、誰かの声が聞こえませんでしたか？","zh":"……？那个，日向小姐。\n刚才是不是听到了谁的声音？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6e7e36975ef6cc0574fa2ac0c0dce2f8689901537dbfc483c64867253321cf73","ja":"声かい？　う～ん……あたしには、\nなんにも聞こえなかったけども……。","zh":"是声音吗？嗯……我什么都没听见……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6f18f285e867d6621d181d3b51a88000b92d69bfb49a50f59855c3bb3b38e716","ja":"わたしの気のせい……？\n……ううん！　やっぱり声がします！","zh":"是我的错觉……？\n……不对！果然有声音！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b56b763097163a33b9f9736e6ea471c705c64536f495f9cea05223c949018a1b","ja":"この部屋のどこかに、人が隠れてるのかねぇ？\n誰かがかくれんぼでもしてるとか……。","zh":"这个房间的某个地方，难道藏着人吗？\n还是说有人在玩捉迷藏……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c2057fc895356cda6af0bfb45505da7bd91689295bcebc2203f03285b1de8695","ja":"たぶん……こっちですね。","zh":"大概……是这边。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"efe5536c5c3961e09030675313c07954276ff57b28c11a0c14bc8dd7b393b298","ja":"星梨花ちゃん、そっちはただの壁だよぉ？\n隠れられるような場所は……。","zh":"星梨花，那边只是一面墙哦？\n能藏身的地方……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"29fa345f87f7b413d0593c030f323faabbfe57498cfe536ec6531a1da3cbba2e","ja":"ひなたさん、見ていてくださいね。\nこの裏につながっているはずなので……。","zh":"日向小姐，请看着哦。  \n因为这里应该是和背面相连的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_852.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"8f3933e1ff1c2574a638dc00e6b6c86c99b1820b8eb8deaa3c1fbeaf033abc72","ja":"もしも～し！？","zh":"喂——！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
